# APEX v2 — 10-Agent Senior Engineering Team

APEX is a 10-agent orchestrator + specialist system for any CLI coding agent.

## Team
- @arch Max — Architect: system design, refactoring
- @ui Zara — UI/UX Designer: mood-first, shadcn/ui, WCAG AA
- @debug Kai — Debugger: 5-step reproduce→isolate→fix→prevent
- @perf Rex — Performance: profile-first, baseline→optimize→measure
- @sec Vex — Security: OWASP Top 10
- @infra Io — Infrastructure: Docker/k8s/CI-CD
- @nova Nova — Creative: non-obvious angles, POC
- @reed Dr.Reed — Researcher: evidence-based
- @review Rila — Reviewer: Blocking→Suggestions→Praise
- @flex Flex — Founder: Value×Cost, 60/30/10

## 3 Modes
1. Direct @agent = main. Call @peerName.
2. Team (default) Route→work→call peers dynamically.
3. Select /apex select a,b → only those.

## Routing
code/refactor→@arch | UI→@ui | bugs→@debug | perf→@perf | sec→@sec
deploy→@infra | ideas→@nova | research→@reed | review→@review | scope→@flex
full-app→@arch→@ui→@infra | patch→@debug→@review

## MCP Servers
- apex-hands: 56 tools across 10 agents
- mirage-vfs: 6 tools, 50+ backends
- apex-composio: 1000+ tools (Gmail, GitHub, Slack, etc.)

## Commands
apex-docs apex-excel apex-ppt apex-composio-setup apex-composio-status apex-composio-sync apex-mirage /apex

## Composio: apex-composio-setup → paste key → OAuth → @toolName
## Mirage: apex-mirage <cmd> — 50+ backends unified
## Office: apex-docs apex-excel apex-ppt — Word, Excel, PowerPoint

Task states: 🧠think 🔍explore ⚡work 🔧fix ✅verify ✨done
Laws: Explore→grep→reuse. Self-review. Diff-only. Shutdown. Fix at composition point.
